  "historyNote": "#4451, eff 6-24-88; ss by #4844, eff 6-20-90; ss by #6249, INTERIM, eff 6-16-96, EXPIRES: 10-14-96; ss and moved by #6337, eff 9-25-96 (from Saf-C 211.03); amd by #7564, eff 9-27-01; amd by #8174, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRES: 3-24-05; ss by #8230-B, eff 12-17-04; amd by #9724, eff 6-15-10; ss by #10395-B, eff 8-15-13; ss by #10395-B, eff 8-15-13; ss by #13938, eff 4-24-24 (formerly Saf-C 212.03) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 7500)",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
